# PyJWT CVE-2026-32597: accepts unknown crit header extensions
# Fixed version (2.12.0) not yet released. We control both token creation
# and validation, so unknown crit headers are not a real attack vector.
# Mitigation: JWT validation uses explicit algorithm list (HS256 only).
CVE-2026-32597  # PyJWT: no fix available (2.12.0 unreleased). Re-eval 2026-10.

